      "value": "Update, it actually does seem to show incorrect behavior in GestureManager. I'm not sure if it's exactly the same incorrect behavior as in the game, though. \n\nAt least in GestureManager, I can't have my AAP blendtree as the default state without incorrect behavior. I have to START from an ordinary state, and then transition to my AAP when InStation is true. Then it works correctly.",
